{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12384","headline":"送任先生任唐山丞 · 钱起","name":"送任先生任唐山丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"再命果良愿，几年勤说诗。\n上公频握发，才子共垂帷。\n琢玉成良器，出门偏怆离。\n腰章佐墨绶，耀锦到茅茨。\n树老见家日，潮平归县时。\n衣催莲女织，颂听海人词。\n鸿鹄志应在，荃兰香未衰。\n金门定回音，云路有佳期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}